{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"自守层"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"自守层"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>所谓自守层是指"},{"Local":{"url":"几何Langlands对应","text":"几何 Langlands 纲领"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛的模空间","text":"主丛的模空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{Bun}_G$ 上的某些层范畴 (如 $\\mathsf{Sh}_{\\mathrm{Nilp}}(\\mathrm{Bun}_G)$) 的对象, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"自守函数","text":"自守函数"}},{"Plain":"的类比与"},{"Local":{"url":"范畴化","text":"范畴化"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}